{"symbol":"YSN.DE","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:19:50Z","info":{"address1":"KurfUerstenstrasse 58","city":"Essen","zip":"45138","country":"Germany","phone":"49 201 54 54 0","fax":"49 201 54 54 1000","website":"https://www.secunet.com","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","industryKey":"software-infrastructure","industryDisp":"Software - Infrastructure","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"secunet Security Networks Aktiengesellschaft operates as a cybersecurity company in Germany and internationally. It operates in Public Sector and Business Sector segments. The company provides safety audits and analyses; Biomiddle, a middleware for biometrics and eID applications; Bocoa, a digital ID tool; Easygate, an automated border control system; Easykiosk, a self-service kiosk system; SINA workstations to process classified data; Artificial Intelligence; EID public key infrastructure suite to secure digital processes; and GRT platinum edition, a readout tool for sovereign ID documents. It offers Easytower for facial images for all stationary applications; Secunet Edge, a cloud based service; Globaltester, a tool for conformity testing; hardware security modules; secunet konnektor for healthcare telematics; Protect4use to protect digital identity; IT security outsourcing; and Session Border Controller for secure VoIP telephony. In addition, the company offers Secunet Monitor KRITIS, an attack detection solution; SINA Communicator H, a multi-crypto phone; SINA Workflow, digital management of classified information; Stashcat, a secure messaging for police, public authorities, and companies; identity and access management solutions; incident response solutions; systems for modern police work; SINA L2 box to transfer data; SINA L3 box for encrypted information transfer; and SINA Mobile for smartphones. Further, it provides a business continuity management system; security awareness campaign; awareness training and biometric solutions; crypto services and cybersecurity situation; data protection management; information security management; secure web solutions; EES for air, land, and sea borders; security analyses and penetration tests; test lab for IT-conformity. The company was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Essen, Germany.","fullTimeEmployees":1226,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marc-Julian  Siewert","title":"CEO & Chairman of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":358289,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Torsten  Henn","title":"COO & Full Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":545356,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Kai  Martius","title":"CTO & Full Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":547601,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":198.6,"open":194.8,"dayLow":191.6,"dayHigh":200.5,"regularMarketPreviousClose":198.6,"regularMarketOpen":194.8,"regularMarketDayLow":191.6,"regularMarketDayHigh":200.5,"dividendRate":2.58,"dividendYield":1.3,"exDividendDate":1780963200,"payoutRatio":0.4877,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.34,"beta":0.816,"trailingPE":36.8998,"forwardPE":25.3068,"volume":8273,"regularMarketVolume":8273,"averageVolume":7918,"averageVolume10days":12738,"averageDailyVolume10Day":12738,"bid":195,"ask":195.2,"bidSize":218,"askSize":100,"marketCap":1262846720,"nonDilutedMarketCap":1284843097,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":152.8,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":268,"allTimeHigh":608,"allTimeLow":2.3,"fulldayPrice":195.2,"fulldayChange":-3.40001,"fulldayChangePercent":-1.71199,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.56773,"fiftyDayAverage":231.628,"twoHundredDayAverage":196.485,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":2.58,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0129909,"currency":"EUR","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue":1307681152,"profitMargins":0.06956,"floatShares":1609612,"